{"crw-nogi-6116":{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/25/1753775/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Hello"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/25/1753775/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こめんとありがとー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/25/1753775/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/25/1753775/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回の質問は正解者が多かったですねぇ素晴らしい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/25/1753775/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"答えは、\nあらってあげて！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/25/1753775/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って感じで使います"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/25/1753775/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"愛犬のポテトを洗おうか迷ってて、あらっちゃりーやぁー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って使ったので、是非皆さんに答えてもらおうとおもって質問してみたよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/25/1753775/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"同じ広島でも、\n洗ってやりんさい！\n洗ってあげんさい！\nなど、ありますが、私のところは、\nあらっちゃりーや！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/25/1753775/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って使います"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/25/1753775/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/25/1753775/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かずみさんのお母様から頂いた"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/25/1753775/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『人気焼き』\nというものです！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/25/1753775/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これがなんとものすごく美味しくて\n幸せでした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/25/1753775/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かずみさん！そして、お母様！\n有り難うございます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/25/1753775/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おかげで、すごく幸せな一日でした    気持ちも"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/25/1753775/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"happy"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/25/1753775/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"で、宿題もはかどりました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/25/1753775/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/25/1753775/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここだけの話！かずみさんのお母様！物凄く綺麗でスラッとしててビックリした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/25/1753775/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めちゃくちゃ綺麗だった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/25/1753775/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"清潔感あふれてる感じ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/25/1753775/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからもよろしくお願いします"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/25/1753775/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/25/1753775/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/25/1753775/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"happybirthday"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/25/1753775/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おくれてごめんね！\nいつも、優しくしてくれて、\n嬉ーですっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/25/1753775/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからもよろしくっ！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/25/1753775/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だいすきよんっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/25/1753775/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/25/1753775/0011.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、\n畠中さんとかき氷をたべてたら、\n畠中\n『頭いたい』\n和田\n『なんで？大丈夫？』\n畠中\n『かき氷一気に食べた』\n和田\n『何故一気に食べた？\n私、かき氷で頭いたくなったことない！』\n畠中\n『うそやん！いっきにたべて！』\n和田食べ終わった！\n和田\n『ぜんぜんいたくない！』\n畠中\n『動物やん！』\n和田\n『いや！人間だし！』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"結果私は動物らしい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私を動物に例えるとなんだろー？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/25/1753775/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日のタイトルは、一番と二番目の方が、考えてくださったタイトルを使用しました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/25/1753775/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"タイトル文字数に制限があって、少ししかかけないのー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/25/1753775/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんのを使いたいんですけど......"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/25/1753775/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもありがとー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/25/1753775/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まぁここらへんで、\nせーのっ！\nばーーーーぁいっっ！"}],"source":"archive"},"sba-keyaki-9192":{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":" こんばんなーこ(*⌒▽⌒*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"欅坂46の主演ドラマ残酷な観客達の撮影が進んでおります!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ドラマの制服がとてもお気に入り。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN3X4R543CPPQS4TN3WD04Y","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"緑色の制服ってめずらしい～。\nスカートの裾のラインがかわいいです!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私の役名は、長野楓花 という名前です!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ながのふうか 。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"長沢の長が入ってる!!\nみんなちょこっと自分の名前が反映されているんですね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回のドラマは、役名が自分の名前だったので今回、初めて役名をいただいて、\nドラマだー!演技するのか\nという感じがしました。 "},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分ではない人になれるのはとても楽しみです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"撮影は、日々順調に進んでいます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"睡眠と食事がとても大事だなと感じました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"無駄な時間を作らないよう時間を有効に活用していこうと思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"読んでくれてありがとうございました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⊿長沢菜々香⊿"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-10234":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんたん( •ㅈ• )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさんの投票ありがとう\nございました♡\nつ、ついに......名前を発表！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どゅるどゅるどゅるどゅる"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"....。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どゅるどゅるどゅるどゅる"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ででん( •ㅈ• )\n『しりたん』に決定。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからは『しりたん』\n色んなとこにちょいちょい\n活動していくと思うので\nよろしくお願いします♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/yuuri.saito/img/2013/02/07/2747749/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"※喜んでる顔ですw"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日電車のなかで音楽聞いてて\n降りる駅だったから携帯を\nポッケにしまって立ち上がった瞬間！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんと携帯が落ちてそして\nイヤホンが抜けて電車の中で